// Bandit Level 12 → Level 13

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 12 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit12@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 11.

Step3: The file `data.txt` contains a hexdump of a repeatedly compressed file.

Step4: Create a temporary working directory:

        mkdir /tmp/bandit12

Step5: Copy the `data.txt` file into the temporary directory:

        cp data.txt /tmp/bandit12/

Step6: Enter the temporary directory:

        cd /tmp/bandit12

Step7: Convert the hexdump back into its original binary form:

        xxd -r data.txt data

Step8: Use the `file` command to determine the compression format:

        file data

Step9: Rename the file according to the identified compression format and decompress it.

Step10: Continue using the `file` command to identify the next compression format and decompress it repeatedly.

Step11: Repeat this process until the final file is identified as ASCII text.

Step12: Read the final file:

        cat data

Step13: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit13`.

Step14: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit13@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step15: The Bandit Level 12 → Level 13 challenge is solved.

Step16: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
